  "core_idea": "A coach in the Algarve recommended a padel arm sleeve he could not sell. Bought at €32.95 and sold at €39.90 with the margin shown, it is cheaper and faster than ordering one yourself. Portuguese law asks for a registered activity, an invoice per sale, tax on 15% of sales rather than profit, and consumer rules online; health claims are the trap. A Stripe link with MB WAY costs nothing a month, Shopify has an official Claude connector, and Claude can write and prepare most of it while accounts, refunds and the hand-over stay with the person.",
